## Article 23-1. Electronic petition, procedure for its submission and review

```catala
declaration scope Article23_1ElectronicPetition:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  input petitionTextComplete content YesNo
  input authorInfoComplete content YesNo
  input startCollectionDate content date
  input publicationDate content date
  input endCollectionDate content date
  input currentDate content date
  input actualSignatureCount content integer
  input callsForOverthrow content YesNo
  input callsForTerritorialIntegrityViolation content YesNo
  input propagandaOfWar content YesNo
  input incitementOfViolence content YesNo
  input incitementOfHatred content YesNo
  input callsForTerrorism content YesNo
  output requiredSignatureCount content integer
  output collectionDeadlineMonths content integer
  output withinDeadline content YesNo
  output sufficientSignatures content YesNo
  output prohibitedContentPresent content YesNo
  output publicationRequiredWithinTwoDays content YesNo
  output collectionStartedOnPublicationDate content YesNo
  output freeAccessRequired content YesNo
  output electronicRegistrationRequired content YesNo
  output noAutomaticSigningAllowed content YesNo
  output dateTimeFixed content YesNo
  output forwardedToRelevantAuthority content YesNo
  output reviewStartsUponThresholdReached content YesNo
  output reviewDeadlineDays content integer
  output continuationForHearingsAllowed content YesNo
  output procedureSetByRelevantAuthority content YesNo
  output resultsPublished content YesNo
  output responseToAuthorRequired content YesNo
  output responseToNextWorkingDay content YesNo
  output associationInformedOfResponse content YesNo
  output proposalImplementationPossible content YesNo
  output legislationMayBeDrafted content YesNo
  output signatureInfoStoredThreeYears content YesNo

scope Article23_1ElectronicPetition:
  label president_signatures exception default_threshold
  definition requiredSignatureCount under condition
    addressee = President
    consequence equals 25000

  label parliament_signatures exception default_threshold
  definition requiredSignatureCount under condition
    addressee = Parliament
    consequence equals 25000

  label cabinet_signatures exception default_threshold
  definition requiredSignatureCount under condition
    addressee = Cabinet
    consequence equals 25000

  label local_council_signatures exception default_threshold
  definition requiredSignatureCount under condition
    addressee = LocalCouncil
    consequence equals 1000 # Example for local council

  label default_threshold definition requiredSignatureCount equals 0

  label collection_deadline definition collectionDeadlineMonths equals 3

  label within_deadline_default
  definition withinDeadline equals No

  label within_deadline_exception exception within_deadline_default
  definition withinDeadline under condition
    currentDate <= startCollectionDate + 90 day
    consequence equals Yes

  label sufficient_signatures_default
  definition sufficientSignatures equals No

  label sufficient_signatures_exception exception sufficient_signatures_default
  definition sufficientSignatures under condition
    actualSignatureCount >= requiredSignatureCount
    consequence equals Yes

  label prohibited_exception
    exception default_not_prohibited

  definition prohibitedContentPresent under condition
    callsForOverthrow = Yes
    or callsForTerritorialIntegrityViolation = Yes
    or propagandaOfWar = Yes
    or incitementOfViolence = Yes
    or incitementOfHatred = Yes
    or callsForTerrorism = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_prohibited definition prohibitedContentPresent equals No

  label free_access definition freeAccessRequired equals Yes

  label electronic_registration definition electronicRegistrationRequired equals Yes

  label no_automatic_signing definition noAutomaticSigningAllowed equals Yes

  label date_time_fixed definition dateTimeFixed equals Yes

  label review_deadline definition reviewDeadlineDays equals 10

  label results_published definition resultsPublished equals Yes

  label response_next_day definition responseToNextWorkingDay equals Yes

  label association_informed definition associationInformedOfResponse equals Yes

  label implementation_possible definition proposalImplementationPossible equals Yes

  label legislation_possible definition legislationMayBeDrafted equals Yes

  label three_years_storage definition signatureInfoStoredThreeYears equals Yes

  # Define remaining outputs to satisfy compiler
  definition publicationRequiredWithinTwoDays equals Yes
  definition collectionStartedOnPublicationDate equals Yes
  definition forwardedToRelevantAuthority equals Yes
  definition reviewStartsUponThresholdReached equals Yes
  definition continuationForHearingsAllowed equals Yes
  definition procedureSetByRelevantAuthority equals Yes
  definition responseToAuthorRequired equals Yes
```
